title: "Path-Based Gradient Boosting for Graph-Level Prediction: experiment code"
abstract: >-
  Code and results accompanying the paper "Path-Based Gradient Boosting for
  Graph-Level Prediction". Evaluates PathBoost against graph neural networks
  and graph kernel baselines on TUDatasets benchmark datasets.
